---
title: Permissions (Role Management)
description: >-
  Define role-based permissions in Taskip to control what clients, members,
  managers, and administrators can access across all modules and features.
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
Role Permissions define what each user can access, view, and manage within Taskip.

## Purpose

- Control access across modules
- Secure workspace operations
- Define responsibilities per role
- Prevent unauthorized actions

